          <dt>Ambiguity</dt><dd>Hormuz-only deal without nuclear or sanctions = NO. Nuclear-only deal without Hormuz = NO. Agreed-in-principle without signed text = AMBIGUOUS-RESOLVE-AS-NO. MOU extension without new nuclear commitments = NO.</dd>
        </dl>
